{"seq":3,"slug":"dynamic-content-live-regions","title":"动态内容与 Live Regions：实时变化的无障碍通知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-engineering/implementation/dynamic-content-live-regions","wordCount":952,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"动态内容与-live-regions-实时变化的无障碍通知\">动态内容与 Live Regions：实时变化的无障碍通知</h1><p>现代 Web 应用充满动态内容：异步加载的搜索结果、实时表单验证、通知提示、聊天消息……这些内容变化对视觉用户显而易见，但屏幕阅读器用户若没有专门的通知机制就无从感知。Live Regions 是解决这一问题的核心技术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ARIA Live Regions 是通过 <code>aria-live</code> 属性标记的 DOM 区域。当此区域内的内容发生变化时，AT 会自动朗读新内容，无需焦点移动。根据紧急程度，Live Region 有两个主要角色：<code>aria-live=&quot;polite&quot;</code>（礼貌模式，等当前朗读完毕后通知）和 <code>aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot;</code>（强制模式，立即打断朗读）。WCAG 4.1.3 要求状态变化在不失焦的情况下可被 AT 感知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"live-region-的基本机制\">Live Region 的基本机制</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Change[DOM 内容变化] --&gt; LiveRegion{是否在 Live Region 内?}&#10;    LiveRegion -- 否 --&gt; NoAnnounce[AT 不感知]&#10;    LiveRegion -- 是 --&gt; Priority{aria-live 值?}&#10;    Priority -- polite --&gt; Queue[加入朗读队列,等当前完成后播报]&#10;    Priority -- assertive --&gt; Interrupt[立即打断,播报新内容]\">flowchart LR\n    Change[DOM 内容变化] --&gt; LiveRegion{是否在 Live Region 内?}\n    LiveRegion -- 否 --&gt; NoAnnounce[AT 不感知]\n    LiveRegion -- 是 --&gt; Priority{aria-live 值?}\n    Priority -- polite --&gt; Queue[加入朗读队列,等当前完成后播报]\n    Priority -- assertive --&gt; Interrupt[立即打断,播报新内容]</pre><p>关键点：Live Region 必须在<strong>内容变化前</strong>就已存在于 DOM 中（AT 需要先&quot;订阅&quot;该区域）。动态创建的包含 <code>aria-live</code> 的元素不能保证被 AT 识别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基本用法\">基本用法</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 礼貌通知：搜索结果数量 --&gt;&#10;&lt;div aria-live=&quot;polite&quot; aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;sr-only&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- 搜索完成后注入：找到 23 条结果 --&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 强制通知：错误提示 --&gt;&#10;&lt;div aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; role=&quot;alert&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- 严重错误时注入 --&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 礼貌通知：搜索结果数量 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-live</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"polite\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-atomic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sr-only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  &#x3C;!-- 搜索完成后注入：找到 23 条结果 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 强制通知：错误提示 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-live</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"assertive\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  &#x3C;!-- 严重错误时注入 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 正确：更新已存在的 Live Region 内容&#10;function announceSearchResults(count) {&#10;  const region = document.querySelector(&#39;[aria-live=&quot;polite&quot;]&#39;);&#10;  // 先清空再设置，确保即使内容相同也触发变化&#10;  region.textContent = &#39;&#39;;&#10;  requestAnimationFrame(() =&gt; {&#10;    region.textContent = `找到 ${count} 条结果`;&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确：更新已存在的 Live Region 内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> announceSearchResults</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> region</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[aria-live=\"polite\"]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 先清空再设置，确保即使内容相同也触发变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  region.textContent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    region.textContent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `找到 ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 条结果`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"aria-live-的值与适用场景\">aria-live 的值与适用场景</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>off</code></td>\n<td>不通知（默认值）</td>\n<td>不需要通知的区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>polite</code></td>\n<td>等当前朗读完毕后通知</td>\n<td>搜索结果、进度更新、非紧急通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>assertive</code></td>\n<td>立即打断并通知</td>\n<td>严重错误、需要即时行动的警告</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>实践建议</strong>：优先使用 <code>polite</code>，只在内容极其紧急（用户必须立刻知晓）时使用 <code>assertive</code>。<code>assertive</code> 会打断当前朗读，用户体验不好，滥用会让 AT 用户感到厌烦。</p>\n<h2 id=\"aria-atomic-与-aria-relevant\">aria-atomic 与 aria-relevant</h2><h3 id=\"aria-atomic\">aria-atomic</h3><p><code>aria-atomic</code> 控制 AT 是否朗读整个 Live Region 还是仅变化的部分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot;：朗读整个区域内容 --&gt;&#10;&lt;div aria-live=&quot;polite&quot; aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;count&quot;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; 条未读消息&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;!-- 当 count 变为 5 时，朗读&quot;5 条未读消息&quot; --&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- aria-atomic=&quot;false&quot;（默认）：只朗读变化的部分 --&gt;&#10;&lt;div aria-live=&quot;polite&quot; aria-atomic=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;p&gt;最新消息：&lt;span id=&quot;latest&quot;&gt;暂无&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;!-- 当 latest 变化时，只朗读新消息内容，不读&quot;最新消息：&quot; --&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- aria-atomic=\"true\"：朗读整个区域内容 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-live</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"polite\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-atomic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>0&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> 条未读消息&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 当 count 变为 5 时，朗读\"5 条未读消息\" --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- aria-atomic=\"false\"（默认）：只朗读变化的部分 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-live</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"polite\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-atomic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"false\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>最新消息：&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"latest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>暂无&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 当 latest 变化时，只朗读新消息内容，不读\"最新消息：\" --></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot;</code> 适合计数器、状态摘要等需要完整上下文的场景。</p>\n<h3 id=\"aria-relevant\">aria-relevant</h3><p><code>aria-relevant</code> 指定哪类 DOM 变化会触发通知（通常不需要手动设置，默认 <code>additions text</code> 已适用大多数场景）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>additions</code></td>\n<td>节点被添加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>text</code></td>\n<td>文本内容变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>removals</code></td>\n<td>节点被删除（谨慎使用，很吵）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>all</code></td>\n<td>全部变化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"预定义-live-region-角色\">预定义 Live Region 角色</h2><p>ARIA 提供了几个预定义了 Live Region 语义的角色：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>等效属性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>role=&quot;alert&quot;</code></td>\n<td><code>aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot;</code> + <code>aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot;</code></td>\n<td>错误消息、重要警告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>role=&quot;status&quot;</code></td>\n<td><code>aria-live=&quot;polite&quot;</code> + <code>aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot;</code></td>\n<td>操作成功反馈、状态更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>role=&quot;log&quot;</code></td>\n<td><code>aria-live=&quot;polite&quot;</code> + <code>aria-relevant=&quot;additions&quot;</code></td>\n<td>聊天记录、日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>role=&quot;timer&quot;</code></td>\n<td><code>aria-live=&quot;off&quot;</code>（需手动控制）</td>\n<td>倒计时、计时器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>role=&quot;progressbar&quot;</code></td>\n<td>配合 <code>aria-valuenow</code>/<code>aria-valuemin</code>/<code>aria-valuemax</code></td>\n<td>进度条</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- alert：错误消息（assertive）--&gt;&#10;&lt;div role=&quot;alert&quot; id=&quot;error-message&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- status：操作成功（polite）--&gt;&#10;&lt;div role=&quot;status&quot; id=&quot;success-message&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- alert：错误消息（assertive）--></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alert\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error-message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- status：操作成功（polite）--></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"success-message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</spa